  "job_B18.10.2_20251003_114437": {
    "text": "Her ongyn\u00f0 secgean be \u00feam Godes sanctum \u00fee on Engla lande \u00e6rest reston.\nSanctus Albanus martyr in Breotone se reste\u00f0 neah W\u00e6linga ceastre he \u00fe\u00e6re ea \u00fee is genemned\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 Columcylle on \u00fe\u00e6re stowe \u00fee is genemned Duncabeam neah \u00fe\u00e6re ea \u00fee is genemned Tau.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sanctus Cu\u00f0berhtus on \u00fe\u00e6re stowe seo is genemned Ubban ford neh \u00fe\u00e6re ea \u00fee is\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sancta Oswald cyningc on Bebban byrig wi\u00f0 \u00fea s\u00e6, & his heafod reste\u00f0 mid sancte\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sanctus Johannes on \u00fe\u00e6re stowe Beferlic neh \u00fe\u00e6re ea Hull.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 sancte Ecgbyrht, & sancte Wilfer\u00f0 bisceop, & sancte Wihtburht, on \u00feam mynstre \u00fee is\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 sancte Ceadda, & sancte Cedde, & sancte Ceatta on \u00feam mynstre \u00fee is genemned Licetfeld,\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 sancte Higebold on Lindisse, on \u00fe\u00e6re stowe \u00fee is genemned Cecesegi, neh \u00fe\u00e6re ea \u00fee is\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sancte \u00c6\u00f0ered se cyningc on \u00feam mynstre \u00fee is genemned Bardanig neh \u00fe\u00e6re ea \u00fee is\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sancte Eadburh on \u00feam mynstre \u00e6t Su\u00f0wyllum neh \u00fe\u00e6re ea \u00fee is genemned Treonte.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 sancte Gu\u00f0lac on \u00fe\u00e6re stowe \u00fee is genemned Cruland, \u00fe\u00e6t mynster is on middan Gyrwan\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sancte Ealhmund on \u00feam mynstre Nor\u00f0weor\u00f0ig neah \u00fe\u00e6re ea Deorwentan.\n\u00deonne w\u00e6s sancte Botolf gebyrged on \u00feam mynstre \u00fee is genemned Medes hamstede, \u00fe\u00e6t is neahburh\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 sancte \u00c6\u00f0elbyrht \u00e6t \u00feam bisceopstole \u00e6t Hereforda neah \u00fe\u00e6re ea W\u00e6ge.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sancte Cett on \u00feam mynstre \u00fee is genemned Undola, neah \u00fe\u00e6re ea Nen.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sancte Mildburh on \u00feam mynstre Wynlocan neah \u00fe\u00e6re ea \u00fee mon S\u00e6fern hate\u00f0.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sancte Wigstan on \u00feam mynstre Hreopedune, neah \u00fe\u00e6re ea Treante.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sancte Dioma on \u00fe\u00e6re stowe \u00fee is genemned Ceorlingburh, neah \u00fe\u00e6re ea Wenrisc.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sancta Eadgy\u00f0 on \u00fe\u00e6re stowe \u00fee is ge haten Polles wyr\u00f0 neah \u00fe\u00e6re ea Oncer.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sancte Rumwald on \u00fe\u00e6re stowe \u00fee is gehaten Buccingaham, neah \u00fe\u00e6re ea Usan.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sancte \u00c6\u00feelbyrht on \u00feam mynstre \u00fee man hate\u00f0 Bydanford, neah \u00fe\u00e6re ea Usan.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sancte \u00c6\u00feelred \u00e6t Leo mynster neah \u00fe\u00e6re ea Lucge.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sancte Eadmund cyningc \u00e6t Beadrices weor\u00f0e on east Englum.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sancta Osgy\u00f0 oc Cicc neah \u00fe\u00e6re s\u00e6 on Sancte Petres mynstre.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sancta \u00c6\u00feelburh on \u00feam mynstre \u00e6t Beorcingan neah Temese.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 sancte Ercenwald bisceop on Lunden byrig.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sancte Neot m\u00e6sse preost on Eanulfes byrig.\n\u00deonne resta\u00f0 \u00e6t Hramesige Sancte Iua, & Sancte \u00c6\u00feelred & sancte \u00c6\u00feelbyrht.\n\u00deonne resta\u00f0 on Burh Sanctus Florentius martyr, & sancta Cyneswi\u00f0, & sancta Cyneburh, & monige\n\u00deonne resta\u00f0 on \u00feornige Sancte Botulf, & sancte A\u00feulf, & sancte Huna, & sancte \u00feancred, & sancte\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 on Abbadune Sanctus Uincentius martyr.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sanctus Dunstanus arcebisceop, on Cantwara byrig on Cristes cyricean, & fela o\u00f0ra sancta\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sanctus Paulinus on Hrofe ceastre.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sanctus Byrinus se Romaniscea bisceop on Wintanceastre on ealdam mynstre, & sancte\n\u00deonne resta\u00f0 on niwan mynstre Sanctus Iudocus, & Sanctus Grimbaldus.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 sancta Eadburh on nunnan mynstre.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sanctus Oswaldus arcebisceop on Wigera ceastre & fela o\u00f0ra haligra bisceopa mid him.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 sanctus Egwinus bisceop on Eoues hamme neah \u00fe\u00e6re ea Afene.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 sancte Kenelm cynebearn on Winclescumbe.\n\u00deonne reste\u00fe sanctus M\u00e6ildul, & sanctus Aldhelmus, & Iohann se wisa on Ealdelmes byrig.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sancte Iwig & sancta Eadgy\u00f0 on Wiltune.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 sancte Eadweard cyningc & sancta \u00c6lfgyfu on Sceftes byrig.\n\u00deonne reste\u00fe sanctus Aidanus, & sanctus Patricius on Gl\u00e6stinga byrig & fela o\u00f0ra sancta.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sanctus Congarus confessor on Cungres byrig.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 sancta Sidefulla f\u00e6mne wi\u00f0 utan Exanceastre.\n\u00deonne Rumonus episcopus on T\u00e6fistoce.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 sanctus Petrocus on west Wealum be \u00fe\u00e6re s\u00e6 neah \u00feam fleote \u00fee man clypa\u00f0\n\u00deonne reste\u00fe sancte Cu\u00f0burh on Winburnan mynstre, \u00fee \u00e6rest \u00fe\u00e6t lif & \u00feeawas ar\u00e6rde \u00fee man gyt on\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 sancta Frideswy\u00f0 on Oxnaforda.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 sancte Cu\u00f0mann \u00e6t St\u00e6ningum on Su\u00f0sexum neah \u00fe\u00e6re ea Bremre.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 sancte Beocca abbod & Edor m\u00e6ssepreost on Ceortesige \u00feam mynstre, & \u00fe\u00e6r man sloh\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 sanctus Branwalatrus se bisceop on \u00feam mynstre \u00e6t Middletune.\n\u00deonne li\u00f0 Sanctus Melorius confessor on Ambresbyrig.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sancta M\u00e6rwynn abbatissa on Rumesige \u00feam mynstre neah \u00fe\u00e6re ea T\u00e6rstan.",
